1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,500
Delivery! It's a little damp.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,100
A little earlier, in the freezer truck. Two eyes in the dark.

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:10,100
The eyes belonged to a hamster. Kong, the courier who shut the door.

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:14,700
They were scared of each other. Fair enough.

5
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:19,700
Kong showed his badge. Mochi showed his pebble. Introductions done.

6
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:22,300
The driver is a tortoise. That's why they're always late.

7
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,100
Parcels travel in his cheek. Safe, but soggy.

8
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,700
Mr. Giraffe's mailbox is a bit high.

9
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:34,300
A backpack is a bag. And also a slingshot.

10
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,900
Mr. Bear is napping. Just be quiet.

11
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:41,700
Quiet did not happen.

12
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:44,300
Snacks come from the cheek, too.

13
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:49,300
Mochi pointed at home. Kong has no idea where that is.

14
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,700
Just then, a very old parcel rolled out.

15
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:54,300
A parcel Kong forgot. For quite a while.

16
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:56,900
Deliver to: snow, an iceberg, and a penguin footprint.

17
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,500
It was a perfect fit.

18
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:04,700
They decided to deliver this one together.

19
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:08,700
But Mochi's nose moved first. Again. (To be continued)

